# Files uploaded by `gcloud builds submit` (Cloud Build) -- same allow-list
# as .dockerignore, plus the Dockerfile itself which Cloud Build needs.
# Without this file gcloud would fall back to .gitignore and upload far more.
*

!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!src/
!src/**
!models/
!models/live_risk_lgbm.txt
!models/live_risk_meta.json
!data/
!data/processed/
!data/processed/fitted_params.json
!data/processed/m5_weekly.npy

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
src/tests/
**/*.sqlite3*
